## Notes for Phase B (test-writer)

The test-writer needs the following boundary test cases derived from this ADR:

1. `schema_overflow_rate` — run with `metadata = '{"declared_key": 1}'` and sidecar declaring `declared_key` → `schema_overflow_rate == 0.0` (no overflow)
2. `schema_overflow_rate` — run with `metadata = '{"declared_key": 1, "undeclared_key": 2}'` and sidecar declaring only `declared_key` → `schema_overflow_rate > 0.0` (overflow detected)
3. `schema_overflow_rate` — all runs bypassed (no sidecar_path) → `schema_overflow_rate == 0.0` (skip denominator = 0)
4. The denominator is `runs_with_sidecar`, not `total_all` — test this explicitly with mixed sidecar/non-sidecar runs
